# The repo-wide .gitignore excludes .env / .env.* everywhere (real secrets
# should never be committed). This fixture's .env is planted, synthetic, and
# load-bearing for scanner tests, so it must be tracked. See ../README.md
# ("gitignore override" section) for why this file exists and how it is kept
# narrow (it does not blanket-unignore anything else in this directory).
!.env
!.env.*
